        "created_at": "2024-12-21T12:53:33.867Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/puneet_21f3002005\">@Puneet_21f3002005</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sayan\">@sayan</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/21f1002877\">@21f1002877</a><br>\nCould you kindly help with the approach to solve this question?<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/8/3/83d64b26709faa1b474b57c6bd522480e98340ef.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/iOhFzdRHs0yFj14jJ6m9bfyjROn.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/8/3/83d64b26709faa1b474b57c6bd522480e98340ef_2_544x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iOhFzdRHs0yFj14jJ6m9bfyjROn\" width=\"544\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/8/3/83d64b26709faa1b474b57c6bd522480e98340ef_2_544x500.jpeg, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/8/3/83d64b26709faa1b474b57c6bd522480e98340ef_2_816x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/8/3/83d64b26709faa1b474b57c6bd522480e98340ef.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3F3F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">904×830 64.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
