        "created_at": "2024-12-21T18:52:02.559Z",
        "cooked": "<p><code>diff file1.txt file2.txt</code></p>\n<p>We are finding difference between <code>file1.txt</code> and <code>file2.txt</code>.</p>\n<p><code>file1.txt</code> is on left, <code>file2.txt</code> is on right.</p>\n<p><code>&lt;mnop</code> means <code>mnop</code> exists in <code>file1.txt</code> but not in <code>file2.txt</code><br>\n<code>&gt;mnpo</code> means <code>mnpo</code> exists in <code>file2.txt</code> but not in <code>file1.txt</code><br>\n<code>&gt;qrst</code> means <code>qrst</code> exists in <code>file2.txt</code> but not in <code>file1.txt</code></p>\n<p>thus</p>\n<div class=\"math\">\n\\text{number of lines in file2.txt} = \\text{number of lines in file1.txt} + 1 \\\\\n\\text{number of lines in file2.txt} = 4 + 1 = 5\n</div>\n",
